<title>DENMARK: Rieber ups Phoenix bid.</title>
<headline>Rieber ups Phoenix bid.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Rieber and Son said on Tuesday that it was raising its offer for Danish roadbuilder Phoenix Contractors to 725 Danish crowns per A-share and 650 crowns per C-share.</p>
</text>
